---
title: "First-run setup in two steps"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: done
    lg1: error
    lg2: active
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 blue
  s0: Step 1: account incomplete
  s1: Step 1: account filled
  s2: Step 2: workspace incomplete
  s3: Step 2: workspace filled
  s4: Owner and workspace created
  s5: Server rejected the setup
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you fill the account step
  s1 --> s0: you break an account field
  s1 --> s2: you press Next
  s2 --> s1: you press Back
  s2 --> s3: you fill the workspace step
  s3 --> s2: you clear the workspace name
  s3 --> s4: you press Create owner
  s3 --> s1: you press Back
  s3 --> s5: you press Create owner, the server refuses
  s1 --> s3: you press Next
  s5 --> s0: the page shows the error on step 1
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s3 blue
  class s4 teal
  class s5 orange
